    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i think i've seen different versions of this. usually it's a two-stage process, like cooling it from 60c to 20c then down to 5c in a certain timeframe. could you clarify the exact stages and the max time allowed for each to stay compliant with standard food safety regs?",
